            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Moc - Takashimaya",
            "review_text": "Adventure02306861999\n5 contributions\n0\ncom tam moc taka\nOct 2025 • Friends\nCơm Tấm Mộc at Takashimaya offers a delicious taste of traditional Vietnamese cuisine in a clean, modern space. The broken rice with grilled pork is flavorful, tender, and beautifully presented with fresh vegetables and pickles. The fish sauce is perfectly balanced, making the dish even more enjoyable. Staff are friendly, welcoming, and serve food quickly. Although the price is slightly higher than street food, the quality and comfortable atmosphere make it worth it. This is a great spot for both locals and tourists who want to enjoy authentic Vietnamese flavors in the heart of the city\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
